Factory Design Pattern:
It is a creational design pattern that provides an interface to create objects without exposing the object creation logic to client.
Need:
1: Hide obj creation logic
2: reduce tight coupling
3:Instead of client directly creating obj using new, we deligates this responsibity to factory class

Ex: Shape Interface ,Circle Reactangle class and FactoryShape class
we have a common interface called Shape with method draw() and then create different classes such as Circle, Reactangle that implemnets interface
Instead of client deciding which obj to create we introduce a ShapeFactory class that take an input and return object.
